Package: taxmod-printservice
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: sfambach <noreply@github.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8), cups-client, cups-ipp-utils, openssl
Recommends: cups, policykit-1 | pkexec
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/sfambach/taxmod_printservice
Description: Taxmod print service
 Fetches label print jobs from a Taxmod WordPress site and prints them
 through CUPS. Runs as a systemd user service; set it up once per user
 with «taxmod-printservice setup».
